  m_Name: Mail_NoMoreOres
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  mailType: 4
  title: "RESOURCE DEPLETION ALERT"
  message: "URGENT NOTICE:

Our scanning systems indicate that the current mining sector has been completely depleted of all viable resources. There are no more mineable materials remaining in your immediate vicinity.

Please conclude any remaining administrative tasks and prepare for relocation to a new sector. The Corporation will provide further instructions regarding your next assignment shortly.

Thank you for your exhaustive efforts in this sector.

Operations Control Center."
